  "evidence": "Standard Protomaps PMTiles z15 and Mapzen Terrarium z14. Sample at the upper piazza and retain the measured host seam along all four edges. The modeled granite plaza descends toward the Forum on an 11% central grade. Northern and southern transitions follow the adjacent ground; the eastern service strip follows street-side terrain.",
  "limits": [
    "The Forum threshold height and the joins across the ends of the piazza are reconstructed from the museum description, photographs and standard terrain. The site fit is a visual approximation.",
    "The glazing uses an opaque reflective material. The model depicts the established exterior and entrance with simplified plant and vestibule geometry."
